Lab 10: Creating and Managing RESTful Services in Camel
Objectives
Build REST APIs using Apache Camel's REST DSL
Consume REST services through Camel routes
Implement HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) with proper request/response handling
Configure JSON and XML data formats with automatic marshalling/unmarshalling
Prerequisites
Java JDK 11+ installed
Apache Maven 3.6+
Basic understanding of REST concepts
Familiarity with Camel routes and components
Text editor or IDE (VS Code, Eclipse, IntelliJ)
